# BEAST Definitive Ablation and Mutation Test Design

**Version:** 0.2  
**Status:** Pre-execution, reviewer-hardened  
**Purpose:** Answer all remaining limitations in Working Paper v0.3 through a single coherent natural experiment  
**Author:** Byron Bunt  
**Date:** 2026-06-21  
**Changes from v0.1:** Observation count reconciled; Lane A isolation requirement added; commit pinning and drift metadata added; QPCCD metric defined; crystallization durability metric added; seven reviewer-armor controls added; Figure 2 specification added.

