## 1. What This Experiment Answers

The working paper v0.3 states six open limitations. This design closes all six in one experiment.

| Limitation | How this design answers it |
|---|---|
| Phase 1 xAI is single-model | Multi-model layer runs identical families across 5 providers |
| Phase 2 displacement is one transform | Repeated family structure runs each transform to occurrence 10 |
| Phase 3 is negative evidence only | Mutation layer proves safe reuse across controlled repository changes |
| Phases 4-7 are bounded harness demonstrations | Natural no-harness condition uses real agent on real repository |
| Provider drift is uncontrolled | All lanes pinned to same commit and run window; drift is recorded, not ignored |
| No large-scale benchmark yet | Controlled matrix produces 450 lane-level observations; full package exceeds 500 |

