## 15. Claim Boundaries for This Experiment

### What this experiment will support if results hold

- BEAST Compute Governor produces Quality-Preserving Cloud-Call Displacement (QPCCD) for identified deterministic task families, verified across multiple providers and occurrence counts
- Crystallisation trajectories differ by provider fitness, with higher-fitness providers crystallising at lower occurrence counts
- Promoted capabilities survive cosmetic repository mutations and correctly demote under semantic and breaking mutations within milliseconds
- Cross-provider reuse of a crystallised capability produces verified results without a provider call, demonstrating a provider-independent capability treasury
- Natural agent sessions on a real repository produce organic crystallisation events without experimental engineering, confirming inference economy inversion under real working conditions
- Re-crystallisation after a breaking mutation occurs faster than original crystallisation, supporting the accelerated learning hypothesis

### What this experiment will not support even if results hold

- General crystallisation across all possible task families in all repositories
- Crystallisation timelines in repositories significantly different from EdgeK-BEAST
- Safe KV-cache transport across heterogeneous production engines
- Broad production savings without extended natural session evidence
- Stable provider fitness independent of model updates, billing changes, or rate limit drift
- Claims about repositories the natural session did not touch

---

## 16. Sacred Safety Rule

Restated as a design constraint, not a reminder.

**No compute saving counts unless verification quality remains equal or improves.**

QPCCD requires all three conditions simultaneously. Every go/no-go gate enforces the quality condition before the displacement condition. If hidden-test pass rate in Lane C drops below Lane B at any occurrence, that stage fails regardless of how many cloud calls were displaced.

Efficiency without quality is not a result. It is a failure mode wearing a result's clothing.

